              "type": "paragraph",
              "text": "Mistigri is a traditional trick-taking card game using 32-card French or German pack for 3-4 players. It is a Rams-family point-trick game with the Mistigri or Monch as highest trump and wild card."
            },
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "text": "Mistigri is treated as a distinct traditional card game because the source identifies its own player count, pack, rank order, and trick-play objective rather than only listing it as a synonym."
            }
          ]
        },
